
[l_english.DECISION_C12_ANUGYPT_TRADE]
Opening Trade Routes with Anugypt

[l_english.DECISION_C12_ANUGYPT_TRADE_desc]
Anugypt possesses vast lands and a large population. Although we have absolutely no need to intervene in the disputes among their warlords, we can be certain that they will take a liking to our exported goods and resources, eventually becoming a healthy trading partner.\n\nMost importantly, their geographical position ensures that we won’t have to worry about the risks posed by wartime instability. Of course, the existence of the Cyclops Territory has been the main reason we haven’t acted on this idea before. Deploying our troops and constructing a trade railway through the region might finally make this plan a reality.

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_ANUGYPT_TRADE]
开拓安及的贸易渠道

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_ANUGYPT_TRADE_desc]
安及有着广阔的土地和居民数量，虽然我们完全没有必要介入军阀之间的纠纷，但是我们可以确信他们会喜欢上我们出口的商品和资源，并且成为一个健康的贸易伙伴。最为关键的是，他们的位置让我们完全不用担心战乱可能导致的风险。当然，独眼巨人领地的存在成为了我们此前没有这么做的原因，派出我们的部队进入并修建一条贸易铁路或许可以让这个想法成为现实。
